      "name": "GetAdjustedUsage",
      "category": "FXBudget",
      "signature": "GetAdjustedUsage()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "FFXTimeData",
      "docs": "Returns the global FX time / budget ratio but adjusted in various ways better drive FX scaling.\ne.g. Usage goes up in line with the real usage but can fall only at a set rate. Useful to avoid FX flipping on/off if their cost is tipping the usage over the budget.\n* Other adjustments may be made in future."
    },
